BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//WorkBuddy//Game Version Calendar//EN
CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
METHOD:PUBLISH
X-WR-CALNAME:ZZZ - Version Calendar
X-WR-CALDESC:Only Zenless Zone Zero previews and version updates. Leaving a
  game? On iPhone just delete that calendar. On Android\, switch OFF "show"
  in Calendar account settings instead of tapping Delete - deleting one URL
  subscription removes all of them.
X-WR-TIMEZONE:Asia/Shanghai
REFRESH-INTERVAL;VALUE=DURATION:PT6H
X-PUBLISHED-TTL:PT6H
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:zzz-34-preview@game-version-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261102T120000Z
DTSTART:20261120T113000Z
DTEND:20261120T130000Z
SUMMARY:Zenless Zone Zero 3.4 Special Program
DESCRIPTION:Introduces a new Void Hunter alongside a Honkai: Star Rail cros
 sover (Robin and Kafka). Three redemption codes worth 300 Polychrome.\n\nC
 odes expire at Nov 22\, 23:59 (UTC+8)\, 23:59 on day 2 after the stream - 
 52 hours after the stream ends.\n\nAll times are Beijing time (UTC+8).\nEn
 tries marked Estimated or TBC are projected from version cycles and may sh
 ift once officially announced.
LOCATION:Zenless Zone Zero - Official stream
CATEGORIES:Zenless Zone Zero
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT30M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Special Program starts in 30 minutes
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:zzz-34-code@game-version-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261102T120000Z
DTSTART:20261122T155900Z
DTEND:20261122T161400Z
SUMMARY:ZZZ 3.4 - Redemption codes expire (Computed)
DESCRIPTION:Valid 52 hours: stream starts Nov 20\, 19:30\, codes die Nov 22
 \, 23:59 (UTC+8).\n\nThree codes worth 300 Polychrome total.\nOnce they ex
 pire they are gone - no reissues\, no appeals.\n\nRedeem in game under Mor
 e > Redemption Code.\nMissed the stream? The VOD description and the offic
 ial preview page usually list all three codes.\n\nAll times are Beijing ti
 me (UTC+8).\nEntries marked Estimated or TBC are projected from version cy
 cles and may shift once officially announced.
LOCATION:Zenless Zone Zero - Redemption page
CATEGORIES:Zenless Zone Zero
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT2H
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Codes expire in 2 hours - redeem now if you haven't
END:VALARM
